{"title":"Chocolate Bunny","slug":"Chocolate_Bunny","hero":{"file":"Chocolate_bunny_boxed.webp","width":370,"height":387},"pageid":1490,"revid":21262,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T06:05:53Z","lastEditor":"Maxwell Games 3","categories":["Items","Limited","Event_Items","Decorative_Item"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Hop 'N' Shop"},{"label":"Price","value":"🥚12"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v.1.5.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"history","text":"History"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"<b>Nom! Delicious. Don't hop away!</b>\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Chocolate Bunny</b> was sold as a decoration for 12 eggs during the Easter Event.\n</p><p>Upon using the \"<i>Eat Chocolate</i>\" prompt, the player shrinks to a smaller scale.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"history\">History</h2>\n<ul><li>Was added in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Version_1.5.0/\">Version 1.5.0</a>, on the <span title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>;</li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals/\">Eggtastic Hop Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals/\">Eggcelent Deals</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, the price has been changed from <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>35 to $1,600;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hop_'N'_Shop/\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>, the price has been changed from $1,600 to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>12.</li></ul>"}
